{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云行教"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上五部，皆由彼部主依此僧祇律中契同己見者集為一部。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "州稱部者，僧傳之語例。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雖通大乘，非全大教，蓋分通也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "據現今流傳者。　先後次第，依靈芝錄。"}
